  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Orange tile labelled “OS3” with a white icon of a tilted rectangle balanced on a circle. Its text reads “Renforcer la gouvernance de la santé numérique aux niveaux mondial et national” (strengthen governance for digital health at global and national levels).",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "مربع باللون البرتقالي يحمل التسمية “OS3” مع أيقونة بيضاء لمستطيل مائل متوازن فوق دائرة. ونصه: “Renforcer la gouvernance de la santé numérique aux niveaux mondial et national” (تعزيز حوكمة الصحة الرقمية على الصعيدين العالمي والوطني).",
      "lang": "ar",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "橙色图块，标有“OS3”，配有一个倾斜矩形平衡于圆形之上的白色图标。其文字为“Renforcer la gouvernance de la santé numérique aux niveaux mondial et national”（加强全球和国家层面的数字卫生治理）。",
      "lang": "zh",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "Recuadro naranja rotulado “OS3”, con un icono blanco de un rectángulo inclinado en equilibrio sobre un círculo. Su texto dice “Renforcer la gouvernance de la santé numérique aux niveaux mondial et national” (fortalecer la gobernanza de la salud digital a nivel mundial y nacional).",
